# Regulatory document source files (large binaries -- gitignored, store in R2)
# Place documents in the relevant documents/<country-or-scope>/ category folder.
# The folder structure (README.md, manifest.json, .gitkeep) is tracked; binaries are ignored.
documents/**/*.pdf
documents/**/*.docx
documents/**/*.doc
